         "m_FontType": "JuaRegular",
         "m_IsDialogue": false,
         "m_IsFading": false,
         "m_IsVisible": true,
         "m_Speed": 0.0,
         "m_TextContent": "Dear Holey & Moley,\n\nGood tidings, mole brethren! I'm holding the grandest of parties at the town\nsquare, but this party is no ordinary one! 'Tis is a party only for the most\ndeserving, the most dapper, the most party-centric of mole society!\n\nShould you accept the invitation, there are standards to be met.\n\n1) There are holes in walls scattered around the land, only by fitting through\nthem precisely, will you get closer to the party itself.\n\n2) I expect fashion of the highest calibre. We have a fiesta theme going so\nstick to it!\n\n3) Entertainment! The grandest party is incomplete without music, bring something\nentertaining for everyone!\n\nReady to have the grandest time of your lives? Then see you there!\n\nYours Sincerely,\nNolan the Golden"
      }
